==Strategy==
Bring 4 meatshields,Those preferably being [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]],[[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] and two 75 cost meatshields. For attacking use units with decent range such as: [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] and dragon variants.
The metal doges are low magnification so they will die to your ranged attackers so it isn't recommended bringing units with critical attacks

Start by upgrading your wallet and deploying [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]]. Then start spamming meatshields and your ranged attackers. The enemies don't push too much so they should eventually die
Leading to your victory.

